# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up QCSC-Prefect on a Slurm cluster {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"
msgstr "Menyiapkan QCSC-Prefect di cluster Slurm {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide prepares the login node of a Slurm cluster as the workflow host of qcsc-prefect.\n"
"The qcsc-prefect SQD tutorial starts from the result of this guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini menyiapkan login node dari sebuah cluster Slurm sebagai workflow host untuk qcsc-prefect.\n"
"Tutorial SQD qcsc-prefect dimulai dari hasil panduan ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you complete this guide, you have the following items:\n"
msgstr "Setelah menyelesaikan panduan ini, kamu akan punya item-item berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item | Where | Contents |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Login node, the workflow host | Prefect, the qcsc-prefect packages, and the `qcsc-qrmi` command |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Compute nodes, inside Slurm jobs | The QRMI worker: QRMI with its `task_runner` command, and `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | The block that names your IBM Quantum&reg; instance and QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Login node and compute nodes | Your IBM Cloud&reg; API key, instances, and backends for QRMI |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Item | Lokasi | Isi |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Login node, workflow host | Prefect, paket-paket qcsc-prefect, dan perintah `qcsc-qrmi` |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Compute node, di dalam job Slurm | Worker QRMI: QRMI dengan perintah `task_runner`-nya, dan `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | Block yang menamai instance IBM Quantum&reg; dan QPU kamu |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Login node dan compute node | API key IBM Cloud&reg;, instance, dan backend kamu untuk QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run each command in a terminal on the login node, unless the step says otherwise.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan setiap perintah di terminal pada login node, kecuali langkahnya menyebutkan lain.\n"

