"A Slurm cluster with OpenMPI, PMIx, and the QRMI SPANK plugin, which the cluster\n"
"administrator installs. The following guides describe these components:\n"
msgstr ""
"Cluster Slurm dengan OpenMPI, PMIx, dan plugin SPANK QRMI, yang dipasang oleh administrator\n"
"cluster. Panduan berikut menjelaskan komponen-komponen ini:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"
msgstr "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[SPANK plugin for QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"
msgstr "[Plugin SPANK untuk QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[SPANK plugin user guide](/guides/slurm-hpc-ux)\n"
msgstr "[Panduan pengguna plugin SPANK](/guides/slurm-hpc-ux)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A home directory and a work directory that the login node and the compute nodes see at\n"
"the same absolute paths\n"
msgstr ""
"Home directory dan work directory yang terlihat oleh login node dan compute node pada\n"
"path absolut yang sama\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Outbound HTTPS access to GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum, and Prefect Cloud from the login\n"
"node, and to IBM Quantum from the compute nodes\n"
msgstr ""
"Akses HTTPS keluar ke GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum, dan Prefect Cloud dari login\n"
"node, dan ke IBM Quantum dari compute node\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Quantum Platform account with an IBM Cloud API key and at least one instance\n"
msgstr "Akun IBM Quantum Platform dengan API key IBM Cloud dan setidaknya satu instance\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Prefect Cloud account, or a Prefect server that you host\n"
msgstr "Akun Prefect Cloud, atau server Prefect yang kamu host sendiri\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Git, C and C++ compilers, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK, and MPI on the cluster, for the solver\n"
"builds of the tutorial\n"
msgstr ""
"Git, compiler C dan C++, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK, dan MPI di cluster, untuk build solver\n"
"dalam tutorial\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The examples use the Slurm partition `normal` and the compute nodes `c1` and `c2`. Replace\n"
"them with the names of your cluster.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh-contoh memakai partisi Slurm `normal` dan compute node `c1` dan `c2`. Ganti\n"
"dengan nama-nama di cluster kamu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

