msgstr "Langkah 2: Pasang uv {#step-2-install-uv}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) package manager, and check the installation:\n"
msgstr "Pasang package manager [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/), lalu periksa instalasinya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Set the paths and create the work directory {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Atur path dan buat work directory {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide and the tutorials use two environment variables:\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini dan tutorialnya memakai dua environment variable:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable | Example | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | The qcsc-prefect checkout |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | The work directory of the solver jobs and the QRMI jobs |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Variabel | Contoh | Fungsi |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | Checkout qcsc-prefect |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | Work directory untuk job solver dan job QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Both paths must be on storage that the compute nodes see at the same absolute path. If\n"
"your cluster has no `/shared` directory, choose another shared path.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kedua path harus berada di storage yang terlihat oleh compute node pada path absolut yang sama. Kalau\n"
"cluster kamu tidak punya direktori `/shared`, pilih path bersama yang lain.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set the variables, and create the work directory. Set the variables again in every new\n"
"shell before you follow a tutorial:\n"
msgstr ""
"Atur variabelnya, dan buat work directory. Atur ulang variabelnya di setiap shell\n"
"baru sebelum mengikuti tutorial:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To set the variables in every new shell automatically, add them to `~/.bashrc`:\n"
msgstr "Supaya variabel diatur otomatis di setiap shell baru, tambahkan ke `~/.bashrc`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Clone qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Clone qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the repository, and check out a release tag, for example `v0.3.1`:\n"
msgstr "Clone repositorinya, lalu checkout sebuah release tag, misalnya `v0.3.1`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5: Create the workflow environment {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"
msgstr "Langkah 5: Buat workflow environment {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the workflow environment with Python 3.12, and activate it:\n"
msgstr "Buat workflow environment dengan Python 3.12, lalu aktifkan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the qcsc-prefect packages. The `--no-deps` option keeps the exact version pins\n"
"between the packages of the checkout. The tutorial installs the workflow itself:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pasang paket-paket qcsc-prefect. Opsi `--no-deps` menjaga pin versi yang persis\n"
"antar paket dalam checkout. Workflow itu sendiri dipasang oleh tutorial:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the commands are available:\n"
msgstr "Periksa bahwa perintah-perintahnya tersedia:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate `~/venv/qcsc-host` in every new shell on the login node.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan `~/venv/qcsc-host` di setiap shell baru pada login node.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6: Log in to Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"
msgstr "Langkah 6: Masuk ke Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Log in to Prefect Cloud. Choose **Paste an API key**, paste a Prefect Cloud API key, and\n"
"choose your workspace:\n"
msgstr ""
"Masuk ke Prefect Cloud. Pilih **Paste an API key**, tempel API key Prefect Cloud, dan\n"
"pilih workspace kamu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the connection. The output shows `PREFECT_API_URL` and your workspace:\n"
msgstr "Periksa koneksinya. Outputnya menampilkan `PREFECT_API_URL` dan workspace kamu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Optional: use your own Prefect server\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Opsional: pakai server Prefect sendiri\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Skip this note if you use Prefect Cloud. To use your own Prefect server instead of Prefect\n"
"Cloud, follow\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/),\n"
"and set the address of your server in place of `<server-host>`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Lewati catatan ini kalau kamu pakai Prefect Cloud. Untuk memakai server Prefect sendiri, bukan Prefect\n"
"Cloud, ikuti\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/),\n"
"lalu isi alamat server kamu sebagai pengganti `<server-host>`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 7: Store the IBM Quantum credentials {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"
msgstr "Langkah 7: Simpan kredensial IBM Quantum {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run `qcsc-qrmi login` after the Prefect login, because it saves the `qrmi-runtime` block:\n"
msgstr "Jalankan `qcsc-qrmi login` setelah login Prefect, karena perintah ini menyimpan block `qrmi-runtime`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Answer the prompts:\n"
msgstr "Jawab prompt yang muncul:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Paste your IBM Cloud API key. The key is not shown.\n"
msgstr "Tempel API key IBM Cloud kamu. Key tidak akan ditampilkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press Enter to use all instances.\n"
msgstr "Tekan Enter untuk memakai semua instance.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter the number of the default instance, `1` in the following example.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan nomor instance default, `1` pada contoh berikut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enter the number or the name of the default backend, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) in the\n"
"following example.\n"
msgstr ""
"Masukkan nomor atau nama backend default, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) pada contoh\n"
"berikut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The command also prints a note about the compute nodes and `[qrmi]` lines for\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, which the example omits (`...`). You do not need the `[qrmi]` lines,\n"
"because the workflow reads the instance and the backend from the `qrmi-runtime` block.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perintah ini juga mencetak catatan tentang compute node dan baris `[qrmi]` untuk\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, yang dihilangkan dalam contoh (`...`). Kamu tidak memerlukan baris `[qrmi]`,\n"
"karena workflow membaca instance dan backend dari block `qrmi-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `qcsc-qrmi` command has the following subcommands:\n"
msgstr "Perintah `qcsc-qrmi` punya subperintah berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Store the API key, the instances, and the backends, and save the block |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Find the instances and backends again with the stored key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Print the instances and backends, without the key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Check that the instance of the block can use its backend |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Perintah | Fungsi |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Menyimpan API key, instance, dan backend, lalu menyimpan block |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Mencari instance dan backend lagi dengan key yang tersimpan |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Mencetak instance dan backend, tanpa key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Memeriksa apakah instance dari block bisa memakai backend-nya |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the file on the compute nodes {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"
msgstr "Pasang file di compute node {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SPANK plugin reads `qrmi_config.json` on each compute node, from the path in\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, often `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Ask your cluster administrator to\n"
"install your `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` at that path. Install it again after each\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` or `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Plugin SPANK membaca `qrmi_config.json` di setiap compute node, dari path yang ada di\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, biasanya `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Minta administrator cluster kamu untuk\n"
"memasang `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` milikmu di path tersebut. Pasang lagi setelah setiap\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` atau `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Keep **Session Mode** of the `qrmi-runtime` block at `batch`, because the SPANK plugin\n"
"acquires the QPU in batch mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"Biarkan **Session Mode** dari block `qrmi-runtime` tetap `batch`, karena plugin SPANK\n"
"mengambil QPU dalam batch mode.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 8: Create the compute-node environment {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"
msgstr "Langkah 8: Buat environment compute node {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The QRMI worker runs on a compute node, in its own environment. Create it from the same\n"
"checkout. The `--python` option keeps `~/venv/qcsc-host` active:\n"
msgstr ""
"Worker QRMI berjalan di compute node, dalam environment-nya sendiri. Buat environment itu dari checkout\n"
"yang sama. Opsi `--python` menjaga `~/venv/qcsc-host` tetap aktif:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qrmi[ibm]` package provides the `task_runner` command. The tutorial adds the SQD\n"
"compilation hook to this environment, and uses `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` as the\n"
"`python_executable` of `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Package `qrmi[ibm]` menyediakan perintah `task_runner`. Tutorial ini menambahkan hook kompilasi SQD\n"
"ke environment ini, dan memakai `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` sebagai\n"
"`python_executable` di `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9: Verify the setup {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"
msgstr "Langkah 9: Verifikasi setup {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the `qrmi-runtime` block exists:\n"
msgstr "Periksa apakah block `qrmi-runtime` ada:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the stored instances and backends. The command never prints the key:\n"
msgstr "Periksa instance dan backend yang tersimpan. Perintah ini tidak pernah mencetak key:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the default instance can use the default backend:\n"
msgstr "Periksa apakah instance default bisa memakai backend default:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that Slurm runs a job on both compute nodes, also with PMIx:\n"
msgstr "Periksa apakah Slurm menjalankan job di kedua compute node, juga dengan PMIx:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Check the compute-node environment and the work directory on a compute node. The first\n"
"command prints nothing when the imports succeed:\n"
msgstr ""
"Periksa environment compute node dan direktori kerja di sebuah compute node. Perintah pertama\n"
"tidak mencetak apa pun kalau import berhasil:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"to choose the nodes, ranks, and threads of the solver jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Baca [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"untuk memilih node, rank, dan thread untuk job solver.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read the [SQD workflow README](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect/tree/main/algorithms/open_loop/sqd)\n"
"for the configuration file, the solvers, and the run parameters.\n"
msgstr ""
"Baca [SQD workflow README](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect/tree/main/algorithms/open_loop/sqd)\n"
"untuk file konfigurasi, solver, dan parameter run.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [QRMI sampler on Slurm](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_qrmi_slurm_sampler/)\n"
